WEBVTT

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:05.190
A-chan!

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:08.170
Hey, Azuma! What's gotten into you?!

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.110
A-chan!

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.110
It's dangerous to be up there!

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:14.610
You're...

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:15.910
The one from...

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:22.790
A-chan!

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:30.890
A-chan!

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.580
A-chan!

