<b>Matobai
Shuusaku</b>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:14.510
<b>Banryuu
Reoko</b>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:14.510
<b>Arabashiri
Souya</b>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:14.510
<b>Hazama
Zetsubi</b>

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:08.020
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:12.690
Shizuru!

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:15.350
This is no time to get depressed!

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:16.440
Psych yourself up!

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.730
You're a genius, aren't you?!

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:24.190
I'm not gonna give you special 
treatment just because of that!

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:26.410
If you don't know what to do,

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.240
you listen to me!

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:30.390
Got that?

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:41.070
Azuma, I just repaid my debt to you.

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:42.720
Kino-chan, good job!

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.720
A-chan! Hey, A-chan!

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:50.390
Azuma!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:53.810
Sorry we're late.

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:56.300
Everyone, let's do this!

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:57.320
Hii-kun...

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:57.820
Yeah!

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:14.040
Is this...

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:19.230
What is this place?

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:20.660
Are we inside Oubu?

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:22.380
Oh, man! How cool!

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:25.640
This seat is connected to Tsurarai.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:28.430
Yeah, I can feel Iwatooshi, too.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.900
Okay, let's do this, Shizuru!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:37.820
Nod...

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.250
It moves just like we want it to!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.950
Hii-kun... Yeah, it does!

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:57.150
This will work! We can do this!

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:59.420
We can fully control Oubu!

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:03.630
It won't be Entei that protects 
this world, or Reoko, either!

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:04.640
It'll be us!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.180
Die, you monster!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.130
Azuma?!

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:29.020
What? What the hell happened?!

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.220
A-chan?!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.300
Oh, man. Instant defeat?

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:49.370
It seems that, somehow, taking on a Buranki

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:52.090
with all its limbs was too much for them.

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:57.100
Especially when their Oubu is 
still in an imperfect form.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:02.520
Yes, right now, Oubu is little more 
than skin draped over a skeleton.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:04.940
Without flesh and blood,

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:07.370
it has no chance of winning.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:10.560
I only hope they realize that quickly.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.590
What was that thing?

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:17.670
Oubu lost in a heartbeat.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.840
How is that Buranki so strong?

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:28.970
A-chan!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.720
What's wrong? Are you in pain?

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:46.140
A-chan, what's wrong? Did you get hurt?

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:49.030
No, I'm fine. Don't worry.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:52.910
Hey, Azuma! What are you trying to do?

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.410
I'm going after that thing.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:57.630
Hang on! What are you gonna 
do when you catch up to it?

00:05:57.630 --> 00:05:59.670
I'll think about that after I catch up!

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:14.470
We got here ahead of it...

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:17.700
But without our Bubuki, 
there's nothing we can do.

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:18.870
Souya!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:25.150
I picked up some stuff that 
looked useful at the vault.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.640
Thanks!

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:28.700
Merci, Shuusaku.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:31.030
We'll gladly use these.

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:45.500
Well, shall we get this started?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.830
But if we just leap recklessly into the fray,
we won't even manage to buy time.

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.300
We should work together.

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.760
Oh, sorry. I can't do that.

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:59.810
Yeah, banding together and helping 
each other out ain't my style.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:04.060
True. Then we'll just do 
it our way, as always.

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:10.190
Good grief... Is this really how it must be?

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:15.620
"As spring marches on, hair of the dog 
is taken in desperation." By Shiki.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:28.300
Zetsubi!

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.620
Oh, if it isn't Azuma.

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:35.710
Don't make such a scary face.

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:38.240
The Bubuki battle is already over.

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:39.860
Why did you deceive them?

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:43.480
My, my. You truly care for 
your friends, don't you?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.280
Unlike Migiwa...

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:49.360
Azuma, why do you think Oubu lost?

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.320
What?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:54.050
Your failure to draw forth Oubu's true power

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:55.820
was because of you, the heart.

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:59.710
Your heart hurts, doesn't it?

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:01.530
And your left arm, as well...

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:03.830
Or perhaps your whole body?

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:09.980
Damage taken by Oubu is only felt 
by the heart, which is you.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:11.840
How do you know that?

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:14.470
Because it's the same for Reoko-sama.

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:15.840
Reoko, too?

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:18.930
Souya!

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:25.150
We hit it that hard,
and it's not damaged at all?

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:29.360
Could it be... Is this 
headless bastard waking up?

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.860
Mommy, are the Buranki asleep?

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.160
What happens if they wake up?

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:40.130
The headless one that fell ten 
years ago was like this too, wasn't it?

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:45.170
Yes, it controlled gravity to 
dramatically alter its surroundings.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.040
This is almost like terraforming.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.800
Are you saying that's their goal?

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.220
I don't know.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:59.300
There is very little we know about
the titans that we call Buranki.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.040
Now that it's gone this far...

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.310
There's nothing we can do.

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.660
This is looking bad!

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:09.810
What the heck is going on?

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:16.950
Help me!

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:23.950
Oh? Is this your first time 
seeing a Buranki's true form?

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:31.250
Azuma, there's no need for you to pity them.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:32.160
What?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:37.650
The small fry knew what they were 
getting into when they came here.

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.140
They knew it'd cost their lives.

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:43.060
And even dogs know their role, too.

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:49.920
Buying time until Reoko-sama 
arrives is our mission.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.510
We don't need you feeling sorry for us.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:59.990
Heart of the Buranki Oubu, Kazuki Azuma...

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.470
What is required of you 
now is selflessness.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:09.250
What a heart needs is the 
resolve for self-sacrifice.

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:12.050
You must be determined to take on the

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:16.170
pain of Oubu's four limbs and 
all others besides yourself.

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:19.160
Can you do that?

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:27.600
That's Entei and...

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.210
Banryuu Reoko!

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:35.150
<b>Episode 7
The Headless Titan</b>

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:35.150
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.490
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:53.500
Entei...

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.760
So Reoko's here, huh?

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:59.010
Did she kill it?

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:00.560
No.

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.730
Chesuto!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.390
Headless or not,

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:33.900
a Buranki with all its limbs
 may be beyond Entei now...

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:37.000
How infuriating.

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:41.230
I guess Entei can't do 
this without its limbs.

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:43.430
This is all because of your mother, Migiwa.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:44.410
Huh?

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:47.000
Before all of you were born,

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.950
Entei lost its limbs in battle 
against Migiwa's Oubu.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:55.800
If it had its limbs, Reoko-sama would 
never lose to that headless fiend!

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.150
A-chan!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:11:59.900
Kogane-chan!

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:01.230
Everyone!

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.360
Entei's being pushed back?

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:08.120
Just what is that Buranki?

00:12:09.650 --> 00:12:14.360
Even if it has no head or master, 
a Buranki is a Buranki...

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:15.920
I knew this wouldn't be easy!

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.700
I don't need arms and legs to beat you!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:59.540
Reoko-sama!

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:06.590
What's wrong, Headless?

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:12.270
You'll never even come close to 
killing me with attacks like that!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:18.900
The body of Banryuu Reoko can heal 
wounds like these with ease!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.320
Don't! Reoko-sama!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:29.910
This isn't good... At this rate,
even Reoko-sama will...

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:34.870
Lend us your Bubuki, Limbs of Oubu.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:35.700
Huh?

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:39.160
We need your Bubuki to be Entei's limbs.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:42.010
It's the only way to defeat 
the headless Buranki.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:44.560
Don't be dumb! If that's true, then we'll...

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:45.970
Do you hear yourself?

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:48.930
You lost moments ago after
being useless in the fight!

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.060
Still, you expect us to 
just hand you our Bubuki?

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:56.190
If this continues, all living 
things on Earth will die.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:58.620
What the hell...

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:02.850
If that headless Buranki is free to rampage,

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:05.180
it will change its environment drastically,

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:06.950
and all organisms will perish.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:13.400
Mankind has suffered through disasters 
caused by Buranki many times.

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:16.210
Y-You expect us to believe that?

00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:21.340
There is nothing in that 
Buranki's head but anger.

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:22.920
Hurry it up!

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.590
You and we aren't the only
ones who could die here!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:28.350
Azuma! If we give them our Bubuki,

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.610
we'll never be able to use Oubu again!

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:34.560
Yeah, but if we die here, 
what will it matter?!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:38.190
Are you stupid?! You actually 
believe that bitch?!

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.220
What should we do?

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.640
Hey, Azuma!

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:45.320
Hiiragi, we couldn't defeat 
that thing as we are now.

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:47.210
Yeah, but still...

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:50.070
If Reoko-sama is defeated, I will also die.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.830
And I wouldn't lie at a time like this.

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:56.790
Damn... Damn it!

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:02.170
Sever your contracts with 
your Bubuki temporarily.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:17.820
If you think you can devour 
the life of Banryuu Reoko,

00:15:17.820 --> 00:15:20.640
go ahead and try!

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:35.700
Zetsubi? No one asked you to do this.

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:42.000
In that case, I will use the 
limbs of my mortal enemy, Oubu!

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:57.850
It's been so long since I knew the sensation 
of having two arms and two legs...

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:25.430
You keep using the same 
attack over and over!

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:27.500
It's obvious that you have no brain!

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:54.030
Is this Reoko's true power?

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:59.450
We'd never stand a chance against that...

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.770
Son of Kazuki Migiwa...

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:15.040
This is what it means to protect a country.

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:55.130
Righty-chan!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.030
Righty-chan!

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:59.650
Righty-chan got burned up!

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:02.250
All because we lent it to Entei!

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:05.600
We couldn't help it, Kogane. 
There was no other way.

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:08.840
So what do we do now?

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:12.800
There's nothing we can do
with our Bubuki in this state.

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.240
Hey, Hii-kun...

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.680
Are we not going to Treasure Island anymore?

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:27.870
That bitch Zetsubi deceived us.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:32.340
I bet that crap about a secret station
for going to the Buranki nest was a lie.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:34.090
No...

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:37.530
It's all over.

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:40.590
We were naïve. We were children.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:44.600
You only call yourself a 
kid at times like these?

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:48.390
That's right, I'm a kid! 
What's wrong with that?!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:51.090
I don't know the way to the Buranki nest!

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:52.400
Can I help that?!

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:56.920
Or what? Should we have your 
ex-boyfriend tell us the way?

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:58.630
Ex-boyfriend?!

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:00.950
I mean the cue ball, of course.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.280
The way you two flirted while you fought...

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.960
You freaking hussy!

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:06.480
I'll kill you, bastard!

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:08.330
Go ahead and try it!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:09.470
Sounds good!

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:11.890
Stop! Stop it, both of you!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.300
Tsurarai...

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:21.050
Damn it... What do we do?

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:28.810
A-chan, what is this?

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:33.810
I saw something just like it on 
Treasure Island when I was little.

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:37.860
I'm pretty sure this is where we are.

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:41.820
Sorry, A-chan. I can't make sense of this.

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:43.740
Look, Kogane-chan.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.720
It's strange, but just ahead of here,

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:49.250
there's a track that 
continues to the sea.

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:51.040
You're right.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.780
Into the sea?

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:55.580
So a train will run under the water?

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:57.800
An island?

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:01.380
No. This must be the secret 
station Zetsubi told us about.

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:04.110
A light?

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:07.890
It's Treasure Island...

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:14.670
I get it...

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:17.880
Treasure Island is way 
up there, above the sky!

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:22.280
Can you really be sure of that?

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:23.630
Yeah!

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:27.280
Treasure Island, my home, 
is up there! I can feel it!

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:31.340
When you sound so damn sure about it,

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:33.540
there's not much left to say.

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:36.540
God, this pisses me off.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.080
Hiiragi?

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:41.280
We were all deceived by Zetsubi.

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:43.110
She <i>lied</i> to us.

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:45.150
Doesn't that make you angry?

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:48.510
Also, even if we follow that map,

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.690
can you guarantee we'll 
find Treasure Island?

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:51.950
We're going anyway.

00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:54.500
If we go and it's not there,

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:56.190
we'll think about it again.

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:02.170
I can't think that way.

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:05.560
I can't be a nice, trusting guy like you.

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:09.780
Yeah.

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:13.400
Okay! Let's go to Treasure Island together!

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:16.780
I'll see what kind of place 
it is with my own eyes!

00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:17.850
Yay!

00:21:17.850 --> 00:21:20.730
Huh? You had the same 
picture too, Shizuru-chan?

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:23.800
Ha ha ha ha handed down from my mom!

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:28.480
If we don't find Treasure Island, Azuma,

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:30.100
you'll have to answer for it.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.310
Yeah, I know.

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:34.030
Okay, let's go! All five of us!

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:34.920
Yeah!

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:37.940
But Azuma...

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:40.370
What do we do about
our train being destroyed?

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:41.860
Azuma!

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:46.610
We lent our hands and feet to Entei.

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:50.620
I think we should borrow something 
from Reoko this time.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:51.800
Yeah!

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:32.340
You don't understand anything, Azuma.
